    Criteria.quinticBilharz6 (FastLevel.coeffs kp ki ρ r w c P 0 q 0 0 0 4)
      (FastLevel.coeffs kp ki ρ r w c P 0 q 0 0 0 3)
      (FastLevel.coeffs kp ki ρ r w c P 0 q 0 0 0 2)
